          {
            "audited_text": "- 📅 Introducing [`st.datetime_input`](/develop/api-reference/widgets/st.datetime_input) to set date and time in a single widget.\n- 📩 To avoid blocking your script, you can pass a callable to [`st.download_button`](/develop/api-reference/widgets/st.download_button) for on-demand download generation ([#12942](https://github.com/streamlit/streamlit/pull/12942), [#5053](https://github.com/streamlit/streamlit/issues/5053)).\n- 🎤 [`st.chat_input`](/develop/api-reference/chat/st.chat_input) can optionally accept audio input ([#12836](https://github.com/streamlit/streamlit/pull/12836), [#13054](https://github.com/streamlit/streamlit/pull/13054)).",
